{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>視后李佳芯落實接拍港版《悠長假期》，在劇中破格挑戰38歲遭棄婚兼失業雙重打擊熟女「黃子男」，原作由山口智子飾演 …</p><p></p>\n<p>視后李佳芯落實接拍港版《悠長假期》，在劇中破格挑戰38歲遭棄婚兼失業雙重打擊熟女「黃子男」，原作由山口智子飾演。今次改編成15集的香港版，重點聚焦幾位主角於低潮期尋找人生方向，面對珠玉在前的角色設定，Ali自爆在答應參演前也曾經歷了一段不為人知的內心掙扎。</p>\n<h2>李佳芯自認與黃子男本性極為相似</h2>\n<p>Ali在ViuTV製作的第4集製作特輯中，大方分享演繹女主角「黃子男」心路歷程，坦言對這個樂天派角色充滿共鳴。劇中阿南一出場便跌入人生谷底，但Ali指出自己與角色一樣勇於跳出舒適圈，面對未知前路依然選擇勇敢嘗試。她直言<b><strong>「就算唔知聽日係點，佢都會選擇試咗先啦或者到時再，睇吓下一步係點啦」</strong></b>，並將這份不畏未知性格特質直接融入角色演繹之中。</p>\n<h2>挑戰《悠長假期》經典女主角曾陷自我懷疑</h2>\n<p>儘管擁有多部代表作，李佳芯回憶起初次接獲演出邀請時，內心依然承受著極大壓力和質疑。她承認在答應接拍前思考階段最為煎熬，甚至一度在心中反覆反問自己<b><strong>「你真係覺得我得？」</strong></b>，在落實接拍前經歷了一段內心交戰。</p>\n<h2>李佳芯做足功課投入拍攝徹底化解心理壓力</h2>\n<p>當真正下定決心迎接挑戰後，李佳芯迅速調整心態並以高度專業精神投入前期準備工作。她透露只要徹底摸清角色演繹方向，原本縈繞心頭沉重壓力便隨之煙消雲散，她受訪時強調<b><strong>「到你真係落手，做完功課去演嗰下呢，就基本上唔會有壓力㗎喇！」</strong></b></p>\n<h2>兩位導演親自解構挑選《悠長假期》改編理念</h2>\n<p>港版《悠長假期》由楊承恩與李紹波共同執導，兩位導演在特輯中解構了這次大膽嘗試創作心思。當被問及想改編哪個IP時，導演腦海中第一時間便浮現出這部迎來30周年經典神劇，並認為它是一個用愛情包裝心靈慰藉故事。儘管編劇黃綺琳初期曾與網民一樣擔憂破壞經典，但導演堅持香港這個時代需要重新傳遞這種精神內核。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510325392214486_11105663036aff1a1664956.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"調整這張照片的對焦，讓中間拿著碗、表情誇張的女生臉部更清晰銳利，主體更突出，背景保持自然的景深模糊，整體畫質更乾淨清晰.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510325392214486_11105663036aff1a1664956.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>製作特輯分享了Ali在幕後古靈精怪的表情。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510325579989408_1020811826aff1a183066f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"1f4de60a-81a9-48a1-a6d8-08e5f3dc13c4.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510325579989408_1020811826aff1a183066f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>角色設定：39歲、男友走佬、工作失意。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510325762594537_19765906966aff1a19ec9d4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"aee8de4f-9092-4bb2-9cf4-7ecdede2ced4.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510325762594537_19765906966aff1a19ec9d4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510325910223173_19757324266aff1a1bbddb0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"9929f9d2-d75c-4833-98fc-4c4ba3949ae2.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510325910223173_19757324266aff1a1bbddb0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179501158077099816_19613105526afdb3fd36223.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179501158077099816_19613105526afdb3fd36223.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>李佳芯回憶起初次接獲演出邀請時，內心依然承受著極大壓力和質疑。她承認在答應接拍前思考階段最為煎熬，甚至一度在心中反覆反問自己「你真係覺得我得？」（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p></p>\n<p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%91%82%e7%88%b5%e5%ae%89/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">呂爵安</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%82%a0%e9%95%b7%e5%81%87%e6%9c%9f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">悠長假期</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9d%8e%e4%bd%b3%e8%8a%af/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">李佳芯</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3546378\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 20 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T23:24:22.818677+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1284,"images":5,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T22:01:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T23:57:52.757656+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T23:17:50.326625+00:00","content_hash":"7c413ea4a624c2dbd380908c2dc954e73d6827125c9d0cdb47ad0bc3e774d6b7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}